# Build context filter for the root Dockerfile (gate-service).
# The root image only compiles ./app/cmd, so we only need the root Go module
# sources (go.mod/go.sum) plus the app/ tree. Everything else (operator module,
# helm, terraform, scripts, tests, artifacts) is excluded to keep ACR/CI uploads small.
**
!go.mod
!go.sum
!app/
!app/**
# Dockerfile.mock (mock-vllm) needs the standalone mock server script
!scripts/mock_vllm.py
